  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protean Agricultureal Ltd, Kenya and Landbrug og Vindm&#xf8;lledrift.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project proposal concerns the development of Tomoni Aloe Farm. The farm consist of 30 acres of land with basic infrastructural facilities like electricity, water, a farm house and a dam for irrigation. The activities will include the establishment of a propagation unit and a processing plant and thus the production and marketing of Aloe Vera products.
Detailed design of the Aloe Vera processing plant has been carried out and purchase of some of the equipment taken place during the pilot project of Protean Agricultureal Ltd and Landbrug og Vindm&#xf8;lledrift.</narrative>
  </description>
